Reasons of gatewayAPI - 

1 . Ingress has only 2 spec section , 
  a. path 
  b. service 
It lacked canary model of deployment , Web Application Firewall [ WAF ] , Rate limiting , DDoS 
However, these was overcome through annotations but ingress became  very complex. 

	2. It is actually the duty of platform engineer to install ingress Class, however DevOps team too was making the modification of ingress Class in the ingress file. It became confusion .

In order to solve above problems, gatewayAPI came into place. 
Gateway API 
 - gatewayclass resource
 - gateway resource 
 - httproute  resource 


Gateway -  installs  3 custom resources 
 gatewayClass -  It is similar to controller , Defines which controller manages gateways 
  gateway Resource - Defines gatewayclass to be used 
  httpRoute - Defines Routing rules , allows HTTP / HTPPs , Weight based Routing , 
